OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,------,/,..--/.,.-,///
OL,4,CThree arrested after vehicles hit by   
OL,5,Cbricks                                 
OL,6,GThree men have been arrested after     
OL,7,Geight vehicles were damaged by bricks  
OL,8,Gthrown from a bridge on to a busy road.
OL,10,FThe vehicles had their windscreens     
OL,11,Fsmashed between 02:00 and 02:30 GMT on 
OL,12,F31 October while driving under a       
OL,13,Ffootbridge near Bonnie Prince          
OL,14,FRoundabout on the A50, south of Derby. 
OL,16,FPolice said officers attended the      
OL,17,Fscene and carried out a search of the  
OL,18,Farea and in nearby Henshall Drive.     
OL,19,FThey located and arrested three men,   
OL,20,Fwho have since been bailed.            
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
