OL,4,CFacial recognition at city event sees  
OL,5,Cnine arrests                           
OL,6,GOfficers have arrested nine people in  
OL,7,GNottingham city centre after the       
OL,8,Gdeployment of facial recognition       
OL,9,Gtechnology.                            
OL,11,FThe system was unveiled by             
OL,12,FNottinghamshire Police in July with    
OL,13,Fthe promise it would be used only to   
OL,14,Fcheck against a "watchlist" of         
OL,15,Fpotential suspects, and that any       
OL,16,Funmatched scans would be deleted       
OL,17,Fwithin seconds.                        
OL,19,FOfficers said the marked van was used  
OL,20,Fduring the first week of the Winter    
OL,21,FWonderland event, near Old Market      
OL,22,FSquare, from 13 November.         G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
