OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,------,/,..--/.,.-,///
OL,4,CFoxes announce new sponsor after porn  
OL,5,Cactress row                            
OL,6,GLeicester City have announced a new    
OL,7,Gmain shirt sponsor after ending a      
OL,8,Gpartnership with a gambling firm       
OL,9,Gfollowing its appointment of a porn    
OL,10,Gactress as its brand ambassador.       
OL,12,FThe League One side confirmed they     
OL,13,Fhave now partnered with Bossjob, an AI-
OL,14,Fpowered recruitment and job-matching   
OL,15,Fplatform based in Singapore.           
OL,17,FOn Wednesday, the club announced its   
OL,18,Fsplit with BC Game - which was named   
OL,19,Fas a sponsor for the Foxes at the      
OL,20,Fstart of the 2024-25 season.           
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
