OL,4,CCouncil in government talks over       
OL,5,Cbudget shortfall                       
OL,6,GA council has been in "early           
OL,7,Gdiscussions with the government" to    
OL,8,Gaddress a potential significant budget 
OL,9,Gshortfall in the next financial year,  
OL,10,Gaccording to its leader.               
OL,12,FWest Northamptonshire Council said its 
OL,13,Ffinancial problems were caused by the  
OL,14,Frising demand of adult and children's  
OL,15,Fsocial care.                           
OL,17,FMark Arnull, the leader of the Reform  
OL,18,FUK-led council, said: "Like councils   
OL,19,Facross the country, we continue to     
OL,20,Fface significant financial pressures   
OL,21,Fand are exploring a range of measures  
OL,22,Ffor savings and efficiencies."    G4/4 
